    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for a long time against endless waves of wild boars with the lonely protagonist. Then, set your best score and brag to your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the game starts, a boar will spawn at each respawn location. All wild boars rush towards the protagonist. If you defeat a boar, you get 1 point. The game ends when the main character's HP becomes 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takes 40 minutes based on a score of 100</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character moves using W, S, A, and D, J for attack, and K for dash.</p>",
